WEBVTT

00:04.140 --> 00:09.360
This is where we manufacture silk, 
our town's local specialty.

00:09.360 --> 00:10.930
We need to return to the royal capital

00:10.930 --> 00:14.820
after trading our flour for their silk 
thread and fabric to finish our training.

00:14.820 --> 00:16.430
I see.

00:18.780 --> 00:21.470
Isn't this fabric beautiful?

00:21.470 --> 00:23.370
It would look so good on you, Miss Yuna.

00:25.920 --> 00:29.630
No, this one would look better on Miss Yuna.

00:32.170 --> 00:35.130
No, I'm not really into stuff like that...

00:35.130 --> 00:37.040
How about this one?

00:36.310 --> 00:38.650
The girls have gotten really close.

00:37.040 --> 00:39.330
I think this one would be better.

00:39.330 --> 00:44.390
Timol, do you remember when monsters 
attacked the royal capital a little while back?

00:44.390 --> 00:46.230
Huh? Oh, yeah.

00:46.230 --> 00:48.440
My father secretly told me

00:48.440 --> 00:52.310
that an amazing adventurer defeated 
those monsters and protected the capital.

00:52.310 --> 00:56.060
I was so moved by how amazing 
adventurers are after I heard that story.

00:56.590 --> 01:00.520
That's why I was looking forward to hearing 
about the adventures of our escort.

01:01.790 --> 01:05.500
But we ended up with a joke 
of an adventurer like her.

01:05.820 --> 01:07.550
Doesn't it piss you off?

01:07.550 --> 01:08.480
Maricks...

01:08.480 --> 01:09.460
Pops!

01:09.460 --> 01:12.810
Garan! What's wrong? 
We have guests with us right now.

01:14.420 --> 01:16.470
Monsters! Monsters have appeared!

01:16.470 --> 01:18.890
What?! Wh-What kind of monsters?

01:18.890 --> 01:20.460
Where did they appear?!

01:21.000 --> 01:22.720
Please tell us, as well.

01:23.350 --> 01:25.630
Maybe we can be of help to you.

02:56.360 --> 02:59.490
Goblins have appeared near our silkworm nest!

02:59.490 --> 03:03.910
I managed to escape, but there are 
still villagers trapped in the shed!

03:03.910 --> 03:05.110
Silkworm nest?

03:05.110 --> 03:05.980
Yes.

03:05.980 --> 03:08.040
It's near the mountainside over there.

03:08.910 --> 03:11.860
If the nest is destroyed, 
our village specialty will...

03:11.860 --> 03:14.340
No! It's more important to save the villagers!

03:14.340 --> 03:17.670
But Pops! There were more than ten goblins!

03:17.670 --> 03:19.220
We can't handle them on our own...

03:17.670 --> 03:19.220
What did you say?!

03:19.860 --> 03:23.280
It'll take too long to 
ask adventurers for help...

03:23.280 --> 03:24.830
We'll go and save them.

03:24.830 --> 03:25.760
Maricks?!

03:25.760 --> 03:29.280
People are being attacked, 
and their lives are in danger.

03:29.280 --> 03:30.730
We've got to try and save them.

03:31.330 --> 03:34.190
We're the kingdom's students... No, knights!

03:34.190 --> 03:35.970
You're not a knight yet.

03:35.970 --> 03:37.900
Everyone, help me knock some sense into him!

03:38.770 --> 03:40.690
I don't mind helping.

03:40.690 --> 03:42.820
Although there are more now, 
we defeated the goblins yesterday.

03:42.820 --> 03:45.780
I can't turn a blind eye if there's 
a chance we can save lives.

03:49.700 --> 03:51.410
I have some conditions.

03:51.770 --> 03:53.850
First, we can't be reckless.

03:53.850 --> 03:56.170
We have to retreat if it's too dangerous.

03:56.170 --> 04:00.430
And lastly, we will borrow 
the power of Miss Yuna's bears.

04:00.430 --> 04:03.340
Won't it be less dangerous if we 
know where all the monsters are?

04:03.710 --> 04:05.050
Well...

04:05.050 --> 04:07.160
I agree with Miss Shia.

04:07.640 --> 04:09.160
I also agree.

04:09.160 --> 04:12.350
At the very least, we can avoid an ambush.

04:13.340 --> 04:14.650
Fine.

04:15.410 --> 04:18.020
It's true that <i>the bears</i> are useful.

04:18.530 --> 04:19.610
Right.

04:19.610 --> 04:22.150
Please show us the way.

04:22.150 --> 04:22.950
Sorry about this!

04:32.820 --> 04:34.750
Two monsters, coming from the right.

04:40.090 --> 04:43.030
Wow! As expected of students 
from the royal academy!

04:44.770 --> 04:47.950
No, this is nothing.

04:47.950 --> 04:49.460
Let's keep moving.

04:49.860 --> 04:52.470
Yeah, the mountainside shed 
is right in front of us!

04:53.970 --> 04:56.760
Then let's catch our breath here.

04:56.760 --> 04:57.810
Why?!

04:57.810 --> 05:00.770
There are people that need 
our help just ahead of us!

05:01.350 --> 05:04.130
You promised me that 
you wouldn't be reckless.

05:04.130 --> 05:07.240
Everyone is so tired. 
It'd be dangerous to jump right in.

05:07.240 --> 05:10.200
Y-You're right. I'm sorry.

05:10.900 --> 05:12.380
Fine!

05:18.880 --> 05:20.920
Good li'l bears...

05:20.920 --> 05:22.090
What?

05:22.090 --> 05:24.800
Miss Yuna, aren't you tired?

05:25.170 --> 05:28.510
Well, I'm an adventurer. I'm used to it.

05:29.400 --> 05:30.670
No way...

05:48.600 --> 05:50.240
Cattleya! Support Timol!

05:50.900 --> 05:52.450
I-I'm fine!

05:52.450 --> 05:53.710
Got it!

05:53.710 --> 05:55.790
Shia! Cattleya! Let's take them down!

05:55.790 --> 05:56.620
Roger!

05:56.620 --> 05:57.680
I understand!

06:01.050 --> 06:02.590
Fire Ball!

06:04.550 --> 06:05.690
I did it!

06:08.680 --> 06:09.590
Be careful, little lady!

06:09.590 --> 06:10.390
Shoot!

06:13.810 --> 06:16.530
Stay focused. There are five more coming.

06:20.110 --> 06:21.170
<i>Huh?</i>

06:21.170 --> 06:24.530
<i>Just now, didn't she tell us 
before the bears said anything?</i>

06:32.770 --> 06:33.950
Gewn! Geld!

06:34.470 --> 06:37.660
The students from the royal capital saved us!

06:37.660 --> 06:38.720
You saved us!

06:38.720 --> 06:39.620
Thank you!

06:39.620 --> 06:41.270
Thank you!

06:41.270 --> 06:43.090
Thank you very much!

06:43.090 --> 06:46.040
<i>We were able to protect 
people that needed help!</i>

06:46.040 --> 06:47.950
<i>I did it!</i>

06:48.800 --> 06:52.030
But why did so many goblins suddenly appear?

06:52.030 --> 06:55.040
These guys looked like they 
were trying to get in the shed

06:55.040 --> 06:56.890
more than trying to destroy it.

06:58.490 --> 06:59.690
Everyone, run.

06:59.690 --> 07:02.390
Huh? What are you saying?

07:01.520 --> 07:02.770
No, it's already too late.

07:02.770 --> 07:04.230
Everyone! Get away from the shed!

07:14.450 --> 07:15.910
Why?

07:15.910 --> 07:17.040
No way...

07:17.750 --> 07:18.780
That's...

07:19.500 --> 07:21.240
A black tiger!

07:24.170 --> 07:27.750
Those goblins were trying 
to run away from it!

07:31.680 --> 07:33.300
<i>It noticed us.</i>

07:33.300 --> 07:35.910
<i>It's going for us next.</i>

07:36.260 --> 07:39.460
<i>We can't beat it. We're going to die here.</i>

07:39.950 --> 07:42.980
<i>This is all because I said 
I wanted to fight off the goblins!</i>

07:44.990 --> 07:48.690
I-I'll stay here as bait 
while you guys run for it!

07:48.690 --> 07:50.220
Maricks!

07:50.220 --> 07:53.030
I'll take responsibility 
since this is my fault.

07:53.780 --> 07:57.320
We decided to do this together. 
It's not your fault, Maricks.

07:58.330 --> 07:59.950
Take Mister Garan and the others and run.

08:00.370 --> 08:03.000
I'll try to buy us as much time as I can!

08:03.630 --> 08:04.550
Timol!

08:04.980 --> 08:07.360
Two people can buy more time.

08:07.360 --> 08:10.340
Whoever it decides to attack 
first is totally up to chance.

08:12.070 --> 08:14.680
You're acting pretty cool, 
but your hand is shaking.

08:15.580 --> 08:17.010
Yours too, Maricks.

08:20.270 --> 08:22.310
Run once we attack!

08:22.310 --> 08:24.390
Maricks... Timol...

08:30.280 --> 08:31.950
Let's do this, Timol.

08:31.950 --> 08:32.700
Yeah.

08:33.740 --> 08:36.070
What?! You?!

08:36.670 --> 08:38.120
I can't move!

08:38.120 --> 08:39.190
It's no use.

08:39.190 --> 08:42.580
We're already surrounded 
by more than a hundred wolves.

08:44.290 --> 08:48.000
If we try to escape recklessly, 
they might follow us to the village.

08:48.390 --> 08:49.680
When did they...

08:51.140 --> 08:53.790
This is a job for an adventurer.

08:53.790 --> 08:56.340
W-Wait! There's no way 
you can win against them!

08:56.340 --> 09:00.810
Kumayuru, Kumakyu... Keep the wolves 
in check while protecting everyone.

09:03.380 --> 09:05.260
The bears...

09:05.260 --> 09:06.440
They grew!

09:06.440 --> 09:08.690
Shia, take care of everyone.

09:09.010 --> 09:10.720
Yes, I understand.

09:12.240 --> 09:14.290
Shia, why aren't you stopping her?!

09:14.290 --> 09:15.870
Leave this to Miss Yuna.

09:15.870 --> 09:19.860
I can't do that! This is all my fault!

09:20.580 --> 09:21.660
Move out of my way!

09:21.660 --> 09:24.500
Your master might die!

09:30.090 --> 09:31.210
Run!

09:32.210 --> 09:33.090
Huh?!

09:43.580 --> 09:45.390
What in the world is going on?

09:45.780 --> 09:51.380
I thought she was just playing adventurer 
and bought her experience with money?

09:51.380 --> 09:53.530
Isn't she just some bear weirdo?

09:53.530 --> 09:54.750
No.

09:55.500 --> 09:59.990
Miss Yuna is a real adventurer that 
worked hard to get to where she is.

10:00.470 --> 10:02.580
Didn't my mother tell you?

10:02.960 --> 10:08.290
She's hunted orcs, tiger wolves, 
and various monsters all by herself.

10:08.670 --> 10:10.420
She said that, but...

10:10.420 --> 10:14.030
How could we believe it 
when she's dressed like that?

10:14.030 --> 10:17.200
Shia, you knew she was strong.

10:17.200 --> 10:19.640
Why didn't you tell us sooner?

10:19.640 --> 10:22.090
It was my assignment to keep things civil

10:22.090 --> 10:26.300
while you judged her 
based on the way she looked.

10:26.300 --> 10:29.160
You wouldn't have believed me 
even if I told you, anyways.

10:39.240 --> 10:40.110
Miss Yuna!

10:40.110 --> 10:40.700
No!

10:40.700 --> 10:42.280
Fire Ball.

10:47.950 --> 10:49.040
Miss Yuna!

10:49.040 --> 10:50.450
Are you all right?!

10:50.450 --> 10:54.630
Well, getting bitten surprised me a bit.

10:56.260 --> 10:59.200
Welp, I should finish things up.

10:59.200 --> 11:00.930
H-Hey, where are you going?!

11:00.930 --> 11:04.590
I took down the boss, but 
the other wolves are still nearby.

11:04.590 --> 11:06.340
I'm gonna go clean them up.

11:07.780 --> 11:09.350
W-We can help you take care of the wolves...

11:11.340 --> 11:12.690
You'll just get in the way.

11:15.730 --> 11:21.480
<i>Even though I looked 
down on her, that bear...</i>

11:21.480 --> 11:25.180
<i>No, Miss Yuna fought 
alone to protect everyone.</i>

11:26.490 --> 11:28.680
<i>So strong and noble...</i>

11:28.680 --> 11:30.690
<i>She's like a knight.</i>

11:30.690 --> 11:32.520
<i>I want to be just like her.</i>

11:33.330 --> 11:34.890
<i>Shoot.</i>

11:34.890 --> 11:39.260
<i>I already said, "You'll just get in the way,"
with a serious look on my face before.</i>

11:35.250 --> 11:43.050
<b>Bear, Surprising All</b>

11:35.250 --> 11:43.050
<b>Bear, Surprising All</b>

11:39.260 --> 11:42.040
<i>Am I using that as my finisher or something?</i>

11:46.050 --> 11:49.020
<i>This escort job is almost over.</i>

11:49.020 --> 11:51.730
<i>Looks like we'll finish up 
without any problems.</i>

11:51.730 --> 11:56.900
<i>Even so, what size of silkworm 
would make silk thread this big?</i>

11:56.900 --> 11:59.050
<i>Nope! Not thinking about it!</i>

11:59.740 --> 12:02.700
Goblins have appeared near our silkworm nest!

12:03.080 --> 12:04.910
We'll go and save them.

12:05.360 --> 12:08.240
<i>I totally set myself up for that one. Yup.</i>

12:08.240 --> 12:11.460
<i>No way we'd finish without 
anything happening.</i>

12:16.540 --> 12:19.250
Miss Yuna, aren't you tired?

12:19.250 --> 12:22.750
Well, I'm an adventurer. I'm used to it.

12:22.750 --> 12:23.850
<i>That's a total lie.</i>

12:23.850 --> 12:26.350
<i>I've never trained myself for this. 
I'm a shut-in.</i>

12:26.350 --> 12:28.100
<i>It's all thanks to my bear equipment.</i>

12:32.950 --> 12:36.230
<i>The black tiger is a lot more intimidating 
in real life than in the game.</i>

12:36.230 --> 12:39.570
<i>This'll be hard for beginners. 
I should step in.</i>

12:40.540 --> 12:43.860
I-I'll stay here as bait 
while you guys run for it!

12:43.860 --> 12:44.950
Maricks!

12:44.950 --> 12:49.790
<i>I can't believe Maricks would say 
something like that. I'm a little surprised.</i>

12:50.710 --> 12:51.500
Timol!

12:51.990 --> 12:54.360
Two people can buy more time.

12:54.360 --> 12:57.380
Whoever it decides to attack 
first is totally up to chance.

12:59.160 --> 13:01.760
You're acting pretty cool, 
but your hand is shaking.

13:02.690 --> 13:04.090
Yours too, Maricks.

13:09.320 --> 13:12.720
<i>I know. It's time for me to step up, but...</i>

13:14.150 --> 13:17.410
<i>I don't have the heart to 
interrupt this serious scene</i>

13:17.410 --> 13:20.900
<i>of friendship between 
two men with my bear suit!</i>

13:22.360 --> 13:26.510
<i>I totally want its pelt as a rug for the house.</i>

13:26.510 --> 13:31.370
<i>Bear of Fire would burn the fur 
and Bear Cutter would damage it.</i>

13:31.370 --> 13:34.510
<i>Should I suffocate it with water magic?</i>

13:36.210 --> 13:41.200
<i>Ouch, ouch, ouch! It hurts?
 Wait, it doesn't hurt.</i>

13:41.200 --> 13:41.920
<i>Actually...</i>

13:41.920 --> 13:43.880
<i>Ugh! Drool?!</i>

13:43.880 --> 13:45.100
Fire Ball.

13:54.930 --> 13:57.890
<i>I'll think of a different 
finisher next time.</i>

14:05.530 --> 14:07.610
That's all of them.

14:07.610 --> 14:10.700
Y-You saved us. Thank you...

14:11.780 --> 14:15.220
That's right. Thank you 
very much, Miss Yuna.

14:15.220 --> 14:17.200
Yes, we were saved thanks to you.

14:17.200 --> 14:18.250
Thank you, Miss Yuna.

14:18.250 --> 14:19.750
Thank you.

14:19.750 --> 14:22.710
Both our villagers and our village 
were saved thanks to you.

14:22.710 --> 14:24.170
No worries.

14:24.170 --> 14:27.130
It's my job to protect these kids.

14:30.470 --> 14:34.640
<i>He feels conflicted after being 
saved by a bear like me. I get it.</i>

14:34.640 --> 14:36.310
By the way, I'm very sorry, but...

14:36.780 --> 14:39.230
I'd like to check the silkworms’ nest.

14:39.230 --> 14:42.270
Could you come along with us?

14:42.270 --> 14:46.860
I don't mind, but I'm here 
escorting the students.

14:46.860 --> 14:49.520
I don't mind as long 
as Miss Yuna doesn't mind.

14:49.520 --> 14:51.130
I don't mind as well.

14:51.130 --> 14:52.400
I'm fine, too.

14:53.960 --> 14:55.920
<i>Silkworm nest, huh?</i>

14:55.920 --> 14:59.310
<i>Huh? I feel like I'm forgetting 
something important...</i>

15:09.850 --> 15:12.390
Miss Yuna's expression 
when she saw the silkworms!

15:12.770 --> 15:15.820
Miss Shia, it's rude to laugh.

15:19.270 --> 15:21.850
Thank goodness they're all safe!

15:21.850 --> 15:24.150
Squish, squish! Squish, squish!

15:24.150 --> 15:25.940
They are quite cute.

15:29.620 --> 15:34.240
I didn't think the silkworms 
would be monsters and so big!

15:35.550 --> 15:38.130
<i>Jeez, this is why other worlds are so scary!</i>

15:38.130 --> 15:42.790
I still can't believe how strong 
you are, Miss Yuna.

15:42.790 --> 15:45.150
I never said I was weak.

15:46.380 --> 15:47.970
Are you guys free right now?

15:47.970 --> 15:50.220
Maricks? We're free.

15:52.930 --> 15:54.680
What's wrong?

16:00.190 --> 16:01.890
So, uh...

16:02.980 --> 16:05.700
We came to apologize to Miss Yuna.

16:05.700 --> 16:07.270
<i>Miss</i> Yuna?

16:07.270 --> 16:13.490
We didn't believe you were an adventurer, 
and we made fun of the way you dressed.

16:13.490 --> 16:15.250
We were told to ask our 
escorting adventurer for advice

16:15.250 --> 16:18.450
when thinking about doing 
dangerous things, but...

16:19.140 --> 16:20.870
We're very sorry!

16:20.870 --> 16:25.500
I am also at fault. I apologize.

16:25.500 --> 16:27.210
Even you, Cattleya?!

16:29.670 --> 16:31.970
You saved people like us 
who treated you in that manner.

16:33.260 --> 16:34.970
Thank you very much!

16:35.980 --> 16:39.760
Don't worry about it anymore. 
I was just doing my job.

16:40.550 --> 16:44.940
Just, don't judge people 
just by how they look.

16:44.940 --> 16:46.950
But you're actually...

16:46.950 --> 16:47.800
Yeah...

16:47.800 --> 16:48.650
True...

16:48.650 --> 16:50.630
You <i>are</i> a bear, after all.

16:58.300 --> 17:00.350
She was so strong!

17:00.350 --> 17:01.750
So true!

17:29.630 --> 17:31.420
We returned the carriage.

17:31.420 --> 17:34.110
Now we'll need to report to our teacher.

17:34.110 --> 17:36.060
I feel a bit down thinking about it.

17:37.010 --> 17:38.560
Oh, it's Maricks' group!

17:38.990 --> 17:40.830
Did you just get back?

17:40.830 --> 17:45.540
Yeah, we did. Looks like you've 
been back for a while, Jiguldo.

17:45.540 --> 17:49.470
Yeah, I'm sending off 
the adventurers that escorted us.

17:49.470 --> 17:51.610
These two escorted our group.

17:51.610 --> 17:53.450
Huh? Miss Bear?

17:53.450 --> 17:54.260
You're right!

17:54.260 --> 17:55.480
It's Yuna!

17:55.480 --> 17:57.010
Huh? Um...

17:57.010 --> 17:57.970
<i>Who are they?</i>

17:57.970 --> 18:04.660
Sorry. I'm Jaden. I've seen you around 
when I take jobs in Crimonia.

18:04.660 --> 18:07.440
I'm Mel. Sorry for suddenly 
striking up a conversation.

18:07.440 --> 18:11.240
Um, Mister Jaden and Ms. Mel, were you
 also escorting some students?

18:11.240 --> 18:13.780
Yeah, wasn't it super easy?

18:13.780 --> 18:16.860
Since the students are so excellent, 
they never do anything dangerous

18:16.860 --> 18:18.830
and follow our instructions really well.

18:22.030 --> 18:26.600
Um, is that weirdly-dressed girl 
really an adventurer?

18:26.600 --> 18:28.830
Yeah, she's famous in Crimonia.

18:29.240 --> 18:33.040
I see. Is it because she 
always dresses like this?

18:33.040 --> 18:35.660
Miss Yuna was our escorting adventurer.

18:35.660 --> 18:38.030
I won't forgive you if you say 
anything bad about her.

18:38.030 --> 18:42.660
That's right. We'll take you on 
if you want to make fun of Miss Yuna.

18:42.660 --> 18:44.490
Me, too, of course.

18:44.490 --> 18:47.520
The whole Foschurose family 
can take you on as well.

18:48.460 --> 18:51.310
Got it! No need to get so defensive.

18:51.310 --> 18:52.590
Hey, everyone?

18:52.590 --> 18:55.100
You know it doesn't really bother me, right?

18:56.140 --> 18:57.920
We've returned!

18:58.360 --> 18:59.240
Huh?

18:59.240 --> 19:00.450
Oh, my...

19:06.010 --> 19:09.000
Please report the results 
of our hands-on training.

19:09.000 --> 19:12.460
Well, Yuna. Let's talk somewhere else.

19:12.460 --> 19:14.760
I really enjoyed spending 
time with you, Miss Yuna!

19:14.760 --> 19:18.020
Please thank Kumayuru and Kumakyu for us.

19:18.020 --> 19:21.430
I will definitely become a knight that 
protects others, just like you, Miss Yuna.

19:21.430 --> 19:24.180
I feel like I've learned important 
things during this experience.

19:24.180 --> 19:25.970
Thank you very much!

19:25.970 --> 19:27.640
What's going on?

19:29.640 --> 19:31.600
They've changed a lot in a few days.

19:32.740 --> 19:36.380
Well, there was some trouble, 
but I enjoyed it, too.

19:40.930 --> 19:42.570
A black tiger...

19:43.000 --> 19:45.660
It scares me to think what would 
have happened if you weren't there, Yuna.

19:45.660 --> 19:47.280
Thank you so much.

19:47.770 --> 19:51.180
Will they get a lower score 
because of their actions?

19:51.180 --> 19:54.380
They should get a lower score considering 
the danger they brought on themselves,

19:54.380 --> 19:56.980
but the fact that they didn't choose to 
abandon others and prioritize their safety

19:56.980 --> 19:58.590
should also be considered.

19:59.080 --> 20:03.980
Someday, those children will have to 
make choices with lives on the line.

20:03.980 --> 20:06.300
I believe this was a good 
learning experience for them.

20:06.730 --> 20:09.370
Raising leaders is a hard job.

20:09.370 --> 20:12.640
So, what did you think of the children?

20:13.130 --> 20:14.550
Well... Yeah.

20:15.860 --> 20:20.060
Maricks has a lot of drive, but he 
can't see the whole picture sometimes.

20:20.060 --> 20:23.240
Well, that's both a strength and a weakness.

20:23.240 --> 20:27.740
Timol seems timid, but he's 
really bold when it matters.

20:27.740 --> 20:31.700
Cattleya is very good at 
observing her surroundings.

20:31.700 --> 20:32.790
What about Shia?

20:32.790 --> 20:36.500
Shia... I think you know her 
strengths the best, Ms. Ellalaura.

20:38.090 --> 20:41.080
Yuna, would you think 
about doing this job again?

20:41.080 --> 20:41.950
You're surprisingly...

20:41.950 --> 20:42.920
No way.

20:43.330 --> 20:44.700
Oh, too bad.

20:50.040 --> 20:51.810
Miss Yuna!

20:51.810 --> 20:55.400
Shia? Why are you all here?

20:56.600 --> 20:59.150
We were all waiting for you.

20:59.150 --> 21:00.900
Let's have a meal together!

21:00.900 --> 21:01.440
Huh?

21:01.440 --> 21:04.630
You taught us many things. 
We'd like to thank you somehow.

21:04.630 --> 21:07.050
We don't have a ton of money 
since we're students,

21:07.050 --> 21:09.160
but we know a pretty affordable 
place that's delicious.

21:09.160 --> 21:10.680
No, but...

21:10.680 --> 21:14.420
There should always be a party 
at the end of an adventure!

21:14.420 --> 21:16.000
Now, let's go.

21:17.050 --> 21:19.130
Wait, hold on!

21:24.140 --> 21:26.340
Well, putting all of that aside...

21:26.720 --> 21:29.770
It's best to be home!

21:30.430 --> 21:32.430
Dad says the same thing.

21:32.800 --> 21:36.140
I'm glad you didn't get hurt, Yuna Sis.

21:36.140 --> 21:39.110
Jeez, you know I'm strong.

21:39.110 --> 21:43.820
Yeah, but anyone would worry after 
hearing you fought with a black tiger.

21:44.200 --> 21:45.520
Thanks...

21:46.510 --> 21:50.950
<i>I feel bad thinking this, but I'm glad 
Fina's around to worry about me.</i>

21:53.990 --> 21:55.080
That's right.

21:55.080 --> 21:59.740
I made some pudding because I wanted to 
eat some with you when you got back.

21:59.740 --> 22:00.540
Want some?

22:01.890 --> 22:03.040
Of course!

23:35.430 --> 23:40.020
<b>Next Episode</b>

23:35.430 --> 23:40.020
<b>Bear, Guiding the Young Girl</b>

23:35.930 --> 23:37.060
Bear.
